Z||000017||Steve Normington||06-26-2001||11:24 AM||||The Fiero has got more leg room than my pickup truck. The head room is a little limited, especially with a helmet.||||reg||1
Z||000018||terryk||06-26-2001||11:43 AM||||Yeah, after about 2 hours, my left leg starts to get cramped and the auto allows me to stretch it out. On the manual, it gets stuck behind the clutch pedal.||||reg||1
